/S /P
/ActualText (We pushed through two projects at the same time: we tested the superstructures of our robot entirely on a traditional tank drive, with four omni wheels on the four corners and two traction wheels placed in the middle, using two motors of a 15:1 transmission ratio as the power source. Meanwhile, we did two other tests on the chassis.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
